      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Cancellation & Refund Policy | ZAFIRA</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<header class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"nav-in\">\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/\" class=\"nav-logo\"><img src=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/logo-1.png\" alt=\"\"> ZAFIRA </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav-links\"><a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/about/\">About</a><a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/contact/\">Contact</a><div class=\"lang-switch\"><button class=\"lang-btn active\" data-lang=\"en\">EN</button><button class=\"lang-btn\" data-lang=\"es\" onclick=\"try{localStorage.setItem('zafiraLang','es')}catch(e){};location.href='https://zafiramatchagency.com/cancelaciones-es/'\">ES</button></div></nav>\n    <button class=\"nav-toggle\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('mob').classList.toggle('open')\" aria-label=\"Menu\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"mob\" class=\"nav-mobile\"><a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/about/\">About</a><a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/contact/\">Contact</a><div class=\"lang-switch\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><button class=\"lang-btn active\" data-lang=\"en\">EN</button><button class=\"lang-btn\" data-lang=\"es\" onclick=\"try{localStorage.setItem('zafiraLang','es')}catch(e){};location.href='https://zafiramatchagency.com/cancelaciones-es/'\">ES</button></div></div>\n</header>\n<main style=\"padding-top:120px;padding-bottom:40px\">\n  <section class=\"sec\">\n    <div class=\"wrap-md\">\n      <h1 class=\"heading-display\">Cancellation <span class=\"text-gold\">&amp; Refund Policy</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"text-body\" style=\"margin-bottom:48px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);font-size:.82rem\">Last updated: September 2026</p>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:48px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n          <p class=\"text-body\">At Zafira Match Agency we work to offer an exclusive, organised and fully personalised experience in each of our services.</p>\n          <div class=\"info-callout\"><p class=\"text-body\">For this reason, once services have been started or purchased, they may not be cancelled unilaterally by the user and are not subject to returns or refunds, in accordance with the specific conditions agreed for each case.</p></div>\n          <div class=\"info-callout\"><p class=\"text-body\">Refunds shall proceed only where a mandatory legal obligation so determines.</p></div>\n          <p class=\"text-body\">By contracting our services, the user confirms that they know and accept each of the conditions set out in this Cancellation and Refund Policy.</p>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-legal\" style=\"margin-top:32px\">This is a courtesy translation. In the event of any discrepancy, the Spanish version prevails.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <nav class=\"footer-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/privacidad/\">Privacy Policy</a>\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/terminos/\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/cancelaciones/\">Cancellations &amp; Refunds</a>\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/about/\">About</a>\n    <a href=\"https://zafiramatchagency.com/contact/\">Contact</a>\n  </nav>\n  <p class=\"text-legal\" style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto\">Zafira is not a dating platform. We are a private matchmaking agency with verified processes. © 2026 Zafira Limited Edition S.A.S. · NIT 902064015-7 · Cl 68 # 57-21, Of. 201, Bogotá D.C., Colombia · +57 310 688 3682 · business@zafiramatchagency.com</p>\n</footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
